File: vUX-dataView.js (NEW FILE)

OLD_SECTION
(none — file did not exist)

NEW_SECTION
New DataView module: keyed data-to-DOM binding for hot-update views. DataView keeps a
JSON model in memory and binds each row to its DOM node by key, so updates are
targeted operations instead of rebuilds or diffs: updateRow writes only changed
cells, sort/setData reorder by moving existing nodes (preserving focus/input state),
filter toggles visibility. Includes the data-v-row / data-v-field template contract.

REASON
Adds a component for tables/dashboards with frequent fine-grained updates, where
innerHTML rebuilds destroy focus/selection state and are wastefully slow.
